{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and up to three friends wake up on a small island with no money. Catch different fish and other sea creatures using everything from fishing rods to assault rifles. Sell your catch, earn money, buy better fishing gear and other useful stuff such as property and boats to expand your fishing empire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here is a gif:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/8304724ad7ff33c248f840643508fc95.poster.avif?t=1759995340\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/8304724ad7ff33c248f840643508fc95.webm?t=1759995340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001890/extras/8304724ad7ff33c248f840643508fc95.mp4?t=1759995340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here are some more features coming before release:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bigger island with  houses and npc characters on it that can trade with you and give you quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boats, to go deep sea fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A character model that isn't a bean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More fishes, including boss fishes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different and upgradeable fishing rods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More weapons, like harpoon guns, melee weapons, and a minigun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here is another gif:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.